&input
    fildyn = 'SrTiO3.dyn'
    zasr   = 'crystal'
    flfrc  = 'SrTiO3.444.fc'
/
! Run LOCALLY (seconds):  q2r.x < q2r.in > q2r.log
! - Reads SrTiO3.dyn0..dynN from the current directory (the downloaded
!   dispersion outputs), Fourier-transforms to real-space interatomic force
!   constants in SrTiO3.444.fc
! - zasr='crystal' applies the sum rule to the Born charges
! - Check q2r.log for "fft-check success" -- confirms the dyn set covers
!   the full 4x4x4 grid consistently
